{"schema_version":"1.9.2","id":"BIT-parse-2026-121413","published":"2026-11-27T05:50:34.737Z","modified":"2026-11-27T06:55:33.484913836Z","aliases":["CVE-2026-121413","GHSA-2j2x-c587-q33g"],"summary":"Parse Server before 8.6.112 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.6 Session Permission Bypass via upgradeToRevocableSession","details":"Parse Server before 8.6.112 and 9.0.0 before 9.10.6 contains an authorization bypass in the session upgrade endpoint, which creates a new session for any valid session token without enforcing the _Session class create class-level permission. Attackers holding a user's session token can send an already revocable token to /upgradeToRevocableSession to obtain additional sessions with fresh expiration that persist after the original session is logged out.","affected":[{"package":{"name":"parse","ecosystem":"Bitnami","purl":"pkg:bitnami/parse"},"ranges":[{"type":"SEMVER","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"8.6.112"},{"introduced":"9.0.0"},{"fixed":"9.10.6"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/bitnami/vulndb/tree/main/data/parse/BIT-parse-2026-121413.json"},"severity":[{"type":"CVSS_V4","score":"CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N/E:X/CR:X/IR:X/AR:X/MAV:X/MAC:X/MAT:X/MPR:X/MUI:X/MVC:X/MVI:X/MVA:X/MSC:X/MSI:X/MSA:X/S:X/AU:X/R:X/V:X/RE:X/U:X"}]}],"references":[{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/parse-community/parse-server/pull/10808"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/parse-community/parse-server/pull/10809"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://github.com/parse-community/parse-server/security/advisories/GHSA-2j2x-c587-q33g"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-121413"},{"type":"WEB","url":"https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/parse-server-before-8.6.112-and-9.0.0-before-9.10.6-alpha.4-session-permission-bypass-via-upgradetorevocablesession"}],"database_specific":{"cpes":["cpe:2.3:a:parseplatform:parse-server:*:*:*:*:*:node.js:*:*"],"severity":"Low"}}